      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B. Theo — framework guidance + review\nTarget role: direct the framework plan and monitor research. Today’s Theo tools return methods and review criteria; they do not inspect case artifacts. MindrianOS must apply the checks locally unless a new approved review integration is built.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 23,
      "containerId": "b3dbc3b527c84b1f9b5e",
      "originalText": "B. Theo — framework guidance + review\nTarget role: direct the framework plan and monitor research. Today’s Theo tools return methods and review criteria; they do not inspect case artifacts. MindrianOS must apply the checks locally unless a new approved review integration is built.",
